          </p><h2
            class="[font-family:var(--sans)] [font-size:clamp(30px,_3.3vw,_43px)] font-black tracking-[-0.055em] leading-[1.13] m-0 mt-[20px] max-w-[690px] text-balance"
            id="process-heading"
          >
            You'll know what happens next.
          </h2>
        </div>
        <ol
          class="grid gap-[30px] list-none m-0 mt-[38px] p-0 min-[900px]:gap-[35px] min-[900px]:grid-cols-[repeat(3,_minmax(0,_1fr))]"
